  Action: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cfdf78d49cfb8534eb01e4b3b2ed32a0, type: 2}
  state: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cfdf78d49cfb8534eb01e4b3b2ed32a0, type: 2}
  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 0
  Text: "The guy is really scared. \nHis name is <link>Sergio Raracara</link>. \nHe
    knows he works for us so no need to worry about squealing. \nHe might be suffering
    from a concussion, but swears that out of nowhere, while he was \"driving his
    own business\", <link>the BIGGEST cow he has ever seen</link> jumped at full
    cow-speed in front of the truck. \nWhen he woke up, the cow was no more but the
    <link>cargo</link> doors were open. So he closed them without looking inside
    as he's not allowed to interact with whatever's in there. He gave us this code:
    <link>285-P9AQ</link>. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
